      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PHOTOBOMB (1) made an eye-catching debut when rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (17.78) at this track over 300m. Exciting prospect and rates the one to beat. SHAKE IT (2) produced a modest effort most recently when eighth at Casino over 411m behind Recruit (24.42) in a Maiden. Was in the money prior to that. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Great chance to atone. COME ON CARDIFF (8) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Worth keeping a close eye on the market. SIDE CHANCE (3) is an improver who can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track when making debut.",
